---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Privacy Policy — Jubilee Square"
  description="Terms of use and privacy policy for Jubilee Square digital services."
  activePage="terms"
>
  <div style="padding-top: 120px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
      Terms of Use &amp; Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px;">1. General Terms</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Welcome to the official Jubilee Square digital platform. By accessing our website or in-mall directory kiosks, you agree to comply with our standard usage policies and respect mall premises regulations.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Privacy &amp; Data Protection</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        In accordance with the Singapore Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), we protect all user enquiries and customer information. We do not sell or disclose visitor data to third parties without consent.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Store Directory &amp; Operating Hours</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Tenant operating hours, promotions, and listings are updated regularly. Individual tenant operating hours on Public Holidays may vary at each retailer's discretion.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px;">4. Management Contact</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted);">
        For leasing enquiries, event space bookings, or feedback, please email <a href="mailto:leasing@jubileesq.com.sg" style="color:var(--accent);">leasing@jubileesq.com.sg</a> or call +65 6451 2388.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
